{"asset_key":"ep8/quest_story_18201260","episode":"ep8","category":"quest_story","story_id":"18201260","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1820126001:1":{"text":"お決まりですか？","source_cn":"决定好了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x40CF66CD3323C4B4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1820126002:1":{"text":"うぅ……はい、これにします！おいくらですか……？","source_cn":"……是的，我想买下这套茶具！请问多少钱？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x51EAE385291B6DAB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1820126003:1":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\">三十モーティマー銀貨</style>、または<style=\"highlight\">同等のバンティス黒鉄貨</style>になります。","source_cn":"<style=highlight>30莫蒂默银币</s...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x455D224165419A19","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1820126004:1":{"text":"えっと……ブライト金貨に換算したらいくらでしょうか？","source_cn":"呃，请问换成耀光的金币要多少？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x29B8844E258B3D34","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1820126005:1":{"text":"ブライト？あいにく、生者の通貨ではお売りできないのです。","source_cn":"耀光？我不收这种活人的钱。只收莫蒂默银币和班题斯黑铁币。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6E73D22C4339E114","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1820126006:1":{"text":"えっ？そんなぁ……ブライト金貨しか持ってないよ……","source_cn":"……啊？怎么这样？但我只带了金币……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x166E8D99CF62DD7E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1820126007:1":{"text":"密航してきたなら、ここで流通してる通貨ぐらい事前に調べておくべきではないですか？","source_cn":"小朋友，你都选择了偷渡，不应该事先了解一下这里流通的货币吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCB907840403E129B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1820126008:1":{"text":"でも密航を手配してくれた人が、ブライト金貨も使えるって言ってました！","source_cn":"负责偷渡的人和我说过，在诺珐斯也可以用耀光金币！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE3D4090B0C177236","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1820126009:1":{"text":"ねえ、店主さん。何かの間違いじゃないですか？","source_cn":"老板，你是不是哪里弄错了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D3C98279CA055F4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1820126010:1":{"text":"それならその方は、一つ言い忘れたようですね。","source_cn":"那他少说了一件事。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC2813DAD6C27D178","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1820126011:1":{"text":"確かに生者の通貨を受け取る店もあります。ですが、それは密航者相手の商売を専門にしているからです。","source_cn":"这里的确有人收活人的钱，但都是那些都是专做偷渡者生意的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x92EF121E6FED2CBB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1820126012:1":{"text":"ここはごく普通の店ですから、生者の通貨は使えませんよ。","source_cn":"我就是做个小本买卖，没那个本钱。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE13C1B39D9D99A7E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1820126013:1":{"text":"じゃあ、どうすれば……","source_cn":"那怎么办……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x89181C10535F35C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1820126014:1":{"text":"やっぱり、うちはどうしてもこのティーセットが欲しい！","source_cn":"老板，我是诚心想要的！您不是也说我的眼光很好吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x67C50BF7836576DD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1820126015:1":{"text":"店主さんが、自分の作品を心から大切にしていることも伝わってきます！","source_cn":"我看得出，您肯定是真心喜欢自己的作品的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A089F437DB61C91","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1820126016:1":{"text":"それなのに、その銀貨や黒鉄貨を山ほど持ってるだけのグレイヴボーンには売って、作品の価値が本当に分かって、大事に使ってくれる客には売らないんですか！？","source_cn":"您难道要错过我这个有品鉴能力、有眼光、爱惜您作品的客人...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x746F4BE377B3B2DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1820126017:1":{"text":"うちは……このティーセットを誰よりも大切に使います！","source_cn":"我……我认为，那些人肯定不会像我这样珍惜您的茶具！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1474719E3AF5610D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1820126018:1":{"text":"……","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1820126019:1":{"text":"フフッ……生者にしてはなかなか面白いお嬢さんですね。いいでしょう、お譲りします。","source_cn":"哈哈，你这个活人小姑娘还真有意思！好吧，我卖给你了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x30E2CEF889C3AD39","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1820126020:1":{"text":"ただし――先ほども申し上げた通り、お支払いは銀貨か黒鉄貨のみです。","source_cn":"不过——还是那句话，我只收莫蒂默银币和班题斯黑铁币。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD8F4ED210DAE70AC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1820126021:1":{"text":"近くの宿屋で両替できますから、それまでこのティーセットはお取り置きしておきますね。","source_cn":"但你可以去附近的旅店兑换货币，我就在这里等你，帮你留着...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA4329B44CB6E581","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1820126022:1":{"text":"それと……両替する際に必ず「1147号室」とお伝えください。","source_cn":"记住，兑换时记得说暗号：“我要住1147号房”。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF9075005CF04C34C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1820126023:1":{"text":"表向き、金貨の流通は禁止されています。なので合言葉を知る者だけが、両替できる仕組みなのです。","source_cn":"明面上，班题斯是不允许流通金币的。只有答对了暗号才能换钱。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9F8F6DD8447029AD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1820126024:1":{"text":"分かりました、すぐ行ってきます！絶対ほかの人に売っちゃダメですからね！","source_cn":"好，我这就去！您可千万别卖给别人啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBB39E3CB1AAE1DF4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:摊主冥妮莎":{"text":"店主のミニサ","source":"摊主冥妮莎","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:薇薇娅":{"text":"ビビア","source":"薇薇娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":25,"localized_text_count":24,"speaker_count":2}}